<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10955" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cōnus</span></b> , i, m., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶνος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a cone.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i><span class="en">Lucr. 4,
			430</span></i> and 432; <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 1, 10, 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 18,
				47 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Esp., of conical bodies, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The apex of a helmet</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 3,
				468</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 3, 108</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 10, 1,
				1, § 2</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig.
				18, 14, 2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The cone of the cypress</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 6, 7,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>A kind of sundial</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9, 8,
				1</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
